WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.450
Yuma... Is this really okay?

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.760
III, his conviction is for real.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.120
We don't even know whether we will win for sure.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.600
I know that!

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.710
But I want to know that guy's true feelings,

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.230
and I truly desire to have a <i>real</i> duel with him.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.900
After all, you can learn everything from the opponent through dueling. Aren't you the one who said that?

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.250
Understood.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.000
I won't say anything more.

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:38.010
But you only have 4 heart pieces so far,

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:42.030
so whether you can qualify for the Finals of the WDC all depends on this duel.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.420
Yuma!

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.980
Everyone! All of you guys have come!

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:52.420
Of course!

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.460
<i>Cat</i>, isn't this the final battle?

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:58.070
I came to here just to see Yuma's face when he loses instantly!

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.030
To summarize, we can't miss this!

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:05.940
So you guys actually thought I would lose?!

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:08.750
Just kidding, that's not what we think!

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:10.960
We all expect you to win, Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:12.150
Huh?

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:18.400
Considering you already got this far... there's no doubt you're the strongest duelist among us!

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:19.900
Do your best!

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:21.850
You can definitely become the champion, <i>cat</i>!

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:22.930
Everyone...

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.430
Alright, let's go!

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.510
What's wrong, V?

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.330
You look quite distressed.

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.950
We can't afford to underestimate the power of the messenger from the Astral World.

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.700
No need to worry. III will win for sure.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:16.370
Since he already acquired strength equivalent of the pain he just endured.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:19.090
A power that strong?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.330
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.380
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:37.640
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:46.900
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:51.400
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:57.860
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:02.660
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:08.330
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:13.590
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.470
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.760
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.930
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.520
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:30.690
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:36.240
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.740
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.740
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:48.540
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:02.010
Number 47: Yuma Gives Up!?
 The Stolen "Bring It To 'Em!""

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.350
Sorry for the wait, III!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:18.110
Yuma, in order to defeat you, I just obtained a new power.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.190
A new power?

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.940
Be careful, Yuma.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:27.830
After the encounter with you and your family, I confirmed something

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:33.160
That I may have to defeat you in order to get back my family!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.170
I just want to know your true feelings!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.710
That's why I want to fight you!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.090
We may become friends after the battle and able to learn everything from each other!

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.760
This is dueling!!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.760
Everyone who stands on that side are all my friends who created bonds with me through dueling!!

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:54.020
Thus I strongly believe there must be such bond between you and me!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:55.650
Let's go!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:56.690
Come!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.360
Duel disk, set!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.990
Duel disk, set!

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.620
D-gazer, set!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>AR-Vision: link established.</i>

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.090
Duel!!

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.680
I will go first!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.930
My turn, draw!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.640
<i>After obtaining power from Tron, in my current state...</i>

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.770
<i>Astral, I can clearly see you!</i>

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.900
<i>You are the one who's been assisting Yuma all this time, right?</i>

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:47.240
<i>But even with you as my opponent, I won't lose!</i>

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:53.120
I activate the Field Magic OOPart City Babylon!

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.000
That's...

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.380
What's this?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:15.890
Here I come, Yuma!

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.560
I special summon the OOParts Monster Tula Guardian!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.940
When there is a field Magic on my field, I can special summon this card from my hand!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:31.450
Then I normal summon the OOParts Monster Golden Shuttle!

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.660
I activate Golden Shuttle's effect!

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:40.580
Once per turn, I can increase this monster's level by one!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:44.630
Is it coming?!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:49.010
I overlay the LV5 Tula Guardian and Golden Shuttle!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:56.390
I build the Overlay Network with these 2 monsters!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.140
Xyz summon!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.480
Show yourself, No. 33!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.030
OOParts Super Weapon Machu Mach!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.490
He already summoned Machu Mach... that fast?

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.370
I set one card face-down, and end my turn.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:20.870
Alright, try to beat me, Yuma! With your dueling!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:25.920
To duel in order to hurt someone is not dueling at all!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.380
That's not the 'Bring it to 'Em' my father has taught me!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:31.930
'Bring it to 'Em'...

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.720
It's a shame that I won't allow you to use that!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.100
Here I come, III!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.690
My turn, draw!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.400
Yes! Here goes!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:44.940
Don't be so hasty, Yuma!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.860
He already has Machu Mach on his field. The top priority right now is to build defense!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:56.700
<i>Plus that momentum of his...
seems quite different than before.</i>

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.830
Anyway, you can't beat him by attacking recklessly!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.790
I know that!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.670
Alright, I set a monster in face-down defense position!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.130
And set one card, ending my turn!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.050
My turn, draw!

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:19.770
I activate the Magic card from my hand, Sarcophagus of Palanque!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:30.530
When there is a card that includes "OOPart" in its card name on my field, I can draw 2 cards from my deck!

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:36.570
Then, during the turn I activated a normal Magic, I can special summon this monster from my hand!

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:41.040
Come forth, OOParts monster Aztec Mask Golem!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.590
Ah... that's III's...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.010
<i>Just like my favorite card! See?</i>

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.720
<i>Aztec... Mask... Golem?</i>

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.020
Go, Aztec Mask Golem!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.480
Palanque Roar!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.940
As I expected, it's Gogogo Golem!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.820
If both of their ATK are 1500, then this battle is a draw.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:19.950
Gogogo Golem won't be destroyed!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:31.050
Plus, when Gogogo Golem is in defense position, once per turn, it cannot be destroyed by battle.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.630
That way I can survive Machu Mach's attack as well!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.430
My goal isn't battle at all!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:42.060
I normal summon the OOParts monster Cabrera's Catapult!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.940
A monster with zero ATK?!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.690
I activate Cabrera's Catapult's effect!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.490
By releasing one monster on my field,

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:03.620
During this turn, the ATK of one monster my opponent controls will become zero!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.080
What...?!

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:09.290
Take the curse, Gogogo Golem!

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.140
Gogogo Golem!

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.140
It's getting troublesome. This combo is...

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:27.270
At this moment, I activate Machu Mach's effect!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:30.730
Machu Mach's effect is, when a monster's ATK changes,

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.940
once per turn, by detaching one overlay unit,

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:38.240
the equal to the changed amount will be inflicted as damage to my opponent!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.570
In other words 1800 damage!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.530
Infinity Cannon!

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:01.390
Since Cabrera's Catapult just used its effect, it switched to Defense Position.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.680
With this, I will end my turn.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.100
Ah, it's no good!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.100
It's... nothing at all!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:20.950
This III guy, his duel is completely different than before! Just what happened...

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:24.870
But... if this is his ace, I got an idea!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.830
This is <i>my</i> duel!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:31.040
I want to win this with my own dueling!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:32.080
Yuma...

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.250
My turn, draw!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.960
I summon Gagaga Magician!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.090
Activate the Equipment Magic!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.350
Shut up, I know!

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.930
I activate the Equipment Magic Bound Wand!

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:58.780
Then once per turn, Gagaga Magician can become any level between 1 to 8!

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.900
Geez, I already said I know!

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.070
I change Gagaga Magician's level to 8!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.040
Alright, Bound Wand's effect activates!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:16.340
The equipped Spellcaster monster gains ATK equal to its level times 100!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:22.470
Alright!! But won't that trigger Machu Mach's effect?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:29.600
No. He won't use Machu Mach's last Overlay Unit for this small amount of damage.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:34.400
Alright, Gagaga Magician, attack Cabrera's Catapult!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.020
I already saw through your attack!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.440
Trap activate! Costa Rican Stone Ball!

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:41.360
What?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:45.280
This card can negate the opposing monster's attack!

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:49.410
And that monster cannot declare an attack during your next turn!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:53.830
Gagaga Magician!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:56.500
<i>How's that, Astral?</i>

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.670
Yuma, set the card.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.920
Ah! Geez, it's all your fault!!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:06.090
I set one card, and end my turn!

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.720
At this moment, Gagaga Magician's level returns to normal.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.850
The ATK raised by Bound Wand's effect will go down as well!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:16.600
My turn, draw!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:21.360
I activate Field Spell OOParts Ancient City Babylon's effect!

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:26.860
Once per turn, by removing one OOParts monster in my graveyard,

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:30.530
I can special summon one OOParts monster with same level from my graveyard!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.080
I banish Golden Shuttle!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:37.370
Alright, pull Aztec Mask Golem out from graveyard!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:48.140
I change Cabrera's Catapult to attack position!

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.850
And once again set Aztec Golem as ammunition!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.770
You... III...

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.100
What happened to you?

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:00.060
Be quiet! It's fine as long as the monsters become my pawns!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:04.440
You used to like OOParts so much... but look what you did to that monster!

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.070
I have changed.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.200
No matter what kind of price I have to pay, I have to defeat you!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:10.530
III...

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.950
I activate Cabrera's Catapult's effect!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:14.910
This is bad!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.120
Another combo with Machu Mach's effect would...

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.460
... would make Yuma only have 300 LP left!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.920
On top of that, if he was attacked by Machu Mach...

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.550
To summarize, Yuma-<i>kun</i> would lose!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.310
I was waiting for this moment!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.350
Use Gagaga Rush, Yuma!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:40.270
Ri... right! Trap activate, Gagaga Rush!

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:46.780
This card's effect is, when Gagaga Magician was targeted by an effect,

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.150
...it will negate its activation, and destroy it!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:58.210
And inflict damage to my opponent equal to the ATK or DEF, whichever is higher, of the monster who used that effect!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:14:59.580
What?!

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:04.670
Cabrera's DEF is 1800, eat this damage!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:16.600
Nice!
Now their LP are even!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.230
Good job!

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.520
Ah... Don't tell me you planned that since the beginning...

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:27.900
Now his duel is too fixated on winning, which sometimes can make him extra cautious,

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:32.070
Compared to a reckless guy like you, he is much easier to analyze in terms of strategies!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.490
Sounds like you said something unnecessary...

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.700
We will win like this! Yuma!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:39.750
Sure!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.250
<i>But, it won't be enough just like that.</i>

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:46.000
<i>I will let that guy find his true inner self through this duel!</i>

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.260
Yuma's 'Bring it to 'Em'... and Astral's advanced tactics,

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.800
Are you telling me their combined power exceeds mine?

00:15:55.050 --> 00:16:00.850
III, sacrificing OOPart's monster, that's not your dueling at all!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.360
I have no idea what kind of power you did got, but you should at least duel in your own <i>style</i>!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.280
You won't understand.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.450
A happy person like you, surrounded with friends, would never understand...

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:20.790
...the true agony and pain I've felt... The feeling of having no one by your side...

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:22.790
III... ?!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.420
I finally managed to find my family, but it's already falling apart!

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.250
Everything has become twisted!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.380
But even so... I still wish to protect them!

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:39.100
Yuma, you annoy me! Your actions are an eyesore!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:43.940
III!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.530
Fall into the darkness!

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.900
Yuma!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:56.910
Yuma!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.670
What happened? The Lord's Key?!

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:23.600
To win against Yuma Tsukumo, having strong Numbers is by far not enough.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:28.940
His father, Kazuma Tsukumo was a brave adventurer.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.070
Such a person's son should not be underestimated.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:36.740
The Power of the Crest I gave to III will take away the most precious things from Yuma...

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:42.660
Afterwards, what's waiting for him is... a world of despair.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.910
I'll bring it to 'em!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.580
Bring it to...

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.170
Bring it...

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:54.800
Bring...

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.470
What...

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.140
What was it?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.770
Just what am I trying to say?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:12.980
It seems I forgot the most important thing to me...

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.910
<i>Come, climb up, Yuma!</i>

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:27.290
<i>That's impossible!</i>

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.210
<i>How can I climb on something this steep?!</i>

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:32.460
<i>No, you can climb on this! (**), Yuma!</i>

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:37.300
<i>Huh? What did he just say? What did you say, dad?</i>

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.930
<i>Dad!!</i>

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:43.890
<i>Dad!</i>

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:48.480
<i>Dad!!</i>

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.440
<i>Scary, so scary!</i>

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:03.950
<i>Hey... you don't want to challenge that, Tsukumo-</i>kun<i>?</i>

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:06.830
<i>I don't wanna... it's so scary!</i>

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.380
<i>How can I jump on something that high anyway?</i>

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:14.590
<i>But how would you know that without challenging it?</i>

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.760
<i>I know that... without doing it.</i>

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.930
<i>I can't do it... can't do it...</i>

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.560
<i>Nice! Perfect!</i>

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.810
<i>You are great, good job!</i>

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.400
<i>You sissy!</i>

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.230
<i>The card you were afraid of was nothing but an Equipment Magic card.</i>

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.320
<i>Oh my, what a boring duel!</i>

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:41.280
<i>To summarize, that was an unworthy duel!</i>

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.330
<i>Such a cowardly guy is a disgrace to duelists!</i>

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:53.080
<i>Scary... so scary!</i>

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:57.800
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:00.010
<i>Sorry... Sorry!</i>

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:04.510
<i>Scary... So scary... Everyone is looking down on me...</i>

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.850
<i>Geez... 
- What an annoying guy he is... !</i>

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:10.600
<i>You would become a coward as well if you are trying to approach him... 
- Such a disgrace of duelists!!</i>

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.230
<i>Scary... Scary!</i>

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.520
<i>Why would it be this scary?!</i>

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:22.150
<i>It's gone... Something important to me...</i>

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.070
<i>...has disappeared...</i>

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.540
Hey, Yuma, hey!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.500
Scary... so scary...

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.750
Why would I duel like this anyway...

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:37.750
- What happened, Yuma?!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.380
Obviously it's impossible...

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.340
How can I possibly win...

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.050
Don't tell me... This all is the power of the crest?!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:50.100
The 'Bring it to 'Em' has already disappeared from his heart, which means Yuma can no longer see you.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:54.850
What?! Yuma! Don't be devoured by the evil power, Yuma!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:59.780
Astral, I won't allow you to interfere!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:03.070
What...?

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:12.790
This crest also has the power to seal <i>you.</i>

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.170
Astral, disappear!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.350
Yuma, your 'Bring it to 'Em' has already disappeared from your memory,

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:34.850
As long as there is no 'Bring it to 'Em', you cannot see neither Astral nor the Lord's Key.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:36.810
You are no longer a match for me!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:41.150
Go, Machu Mach! Attack Gagaga Magician!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.320
Yuma! Yuma!

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.620
Yuma! Yuma!!

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:00.750
Yuma, disappear within the darkness of despair!

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:23.110
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.910
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:41.540
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:45.630
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.470
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:55.930
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:59.270
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:06.360
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:15.790
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.580
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:22.960
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.000
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.590
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:34.010
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:35.890
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:38.140
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:43.860
Due to power of the crest, Yuma has lost his 'Bring it to 'Em'.

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:46.150
There is no more fighting spirit within his eyes,

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:49.030
and that heart of a challenger which vows never give up has also vanished.

00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:50.450
Then even I too...

00:23:53.370 --> 00:23:55.080
Remember it, Yuma!

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:58.080
I... I will surrender the duel...

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.750
This is... the last of my strength

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:05.380
Next time in Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!
 - Astral... dies?!

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:06.710
Yuma...

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:08.250
Don't give up...

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:13.840
The monster we're introducing this week is Drum Devil Tenten Tempo!

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:17.760
You can absorb the opponent's Overlay Units and use them as your own power!

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:20.390
I will use Tenten Tempo to give Yuma a test.

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:21.480
That's eas-

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:22.690
It's the same as three tens.

00:24:22.770 --> 00:24:23.600
Wha?!
